    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia okomenya na Gedalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia magega Nebusaradani, omochiki bw’abarendi, kamorusirie korwa ase omochie o Rama, aase arenge osibire ne chingataare amo nabaanto ba Yerusalemu na Abayuda baria bairetwe Babiloni ase obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omochiki oria bw’abarendi akaira Yeremia ensemo, akamoteebia, “Omonene, Nyasae oo, naraaretie ng’a amang’ana aya amabe nayenyore ense eye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene orentire amang’ana ayio amabe, ere okorire buna akwanete. Ekiagera mwakorete ebibe ase Omonene, gose timwamoigwerete, amang’ana aya amabe abanyorire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, rituko ria reero nkorusia nde chingataare echio ase amaboko ao, nagosiboire. Korarore ng’a mbuya ogende amo nainche Babiloni, inchwo togende, nainche ninkorende buya mono. Korende korarore ng’a tari buya kogenda amo nainche Babiloni, tobaisa kogenda. Rigereria ense yonsi nigo ere ase obosio bwao; genda aase orarore are buya na boronge asore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeremia atarairana kogenda, omochiki oria akamoteebia, “Irana ogende komenya ase Gedalia mosinto bw’Ahikamu, mochokoro o Safani, oyio omorwoti o Babiloni achorete koba omogabana ase emechie y’Abayuda. Nomenye amo nere na amo nabaanto bande, gose genda aande onsi ase oranche.” Erio omochiki oria akamoa endagera amo nebiegwa binde, akamotiga agende aase aganetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akairana, akagenda komenya na Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, agwo Misipa, akaba omenyete amo nabaanto bande, abwo batigarete ase ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia okoba omogambi bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 25:22-24)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abachiki bonsi b’abasikari b’Abayuda, amo nabaanto babo, abwo batigarete ase chinsemo chinde ase ense eyio, bakaigwa ng’a omorwoti o Babiloni obekire Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, koba omogabana ase ense eria, agambere abanto abarenge abataka mono, abasacha na abakungu, amo nabana, abwo batairetwe Babiloni ase obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, na Yohanani, na Yonathani, basinto ba Karea, na Seraya, mosinto o Tanahumeti, na basinto ba Efai korwa Netofa, na Yesania, mosinto bw’omonto oyomo korwa Maaka, amo nabaanto babo, bagachiera Gedalia agwo Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia mosinto bw’Ahikamu, mochokoro o Safani, akariera abachiki baria amo nabaanto babo eira na gotiana, akabateebia, “Timobaisa kwoboa gokorera Abakalidayo mobeere ase ense eye, mobe mokomokorera omorwoti o Babiloni, nainwe namomenye buya motari na bokong’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche omonyene nimenye agwo Misipa, imbe omoteneneri oino ase obosio bw’Abakalidayo abwo bagocha ase tore, korende inwe mobe mogosangereria na kogaacha ase ebigachero biaino edivai, na amatunda ay’ekero ki’omorakeera, na amaguta, na mogenderere komenya ase emechie eyio mwairire ebe eyaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bonsi abarenge ase ense y’Abamoabu, na abwo bamenyete ase egati y’Abaamoni, na ase ense y’Abaedomu, na ase chinse chinde, bakaigwa ng’a omorwoti o Babiloni natigaretie Abayahudi bande ase ense yabo, naende ng’a konya obekire Gedalia mosinto bw’Ahikamu, mochokoro o Safani, obeire omogabana igoro ase abanto abwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Abayahudi abwo bonsi bakairana korwa ase chinsemo chionsi echio ase konya baserigwe gochia, bagacha ase ense yabo, ase Gedalia agwo Misipa. Aroro agwo bagasangereria na kogaacha edivai na amatunda ay’ekero ki’omorakeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia ogoitwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 25:25-26)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, na abaraai bonsi b’abasikari, abwo barenge ase chinsemo chinde chi’ense eria, bagacha ase Gedalia agwo Misipa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakamobooria, “Inee! Nomanyete ng’a Baalisi, omorwoti bw’Abaamoni, otomire Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, agoite?” Korende Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, tegenete amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, agakwana na Gedalia bobisi agwo Misipa, akamoteebia, “Ing’a ribaga ngende ing’ite Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, na omonto onde tari oramanye amang’ana ayio. Nase ki ere aragoite, erinde Abayahudi bonsi bachire asore baserebekane, na abatigari b’Abayuda basire?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, agateebia Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, “Tobaisa gokora egento buna ekio, ekiagera aye nigo ogokwana oborimo igoro ya Isumaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
